flowchart TD

    A{Engine Running?}

    A -->|No| Z[Shutdown]

    A -->|Yes| B[Begin Engine Iteration]

    %% =========================================================
    %% ENGINE COMMANDS
    %% =========================================================

    B --> C[Process Engine Command Queue]

    C --> C1[Window Commands]
    C1 --> C2[Asset Commands]
    C2 --> C3[Scene Commands]
    C3 --> C4[Other Cross-Thread Commands]

    %% =========================================================
    %% WINDOW MANAGEMENT
    %% =========================================================

    C4 --> D[WindowHandler.ProcessPending]

    D --> D1{Pending Window Command?}

    D1 -->|Add| DA[Dequeue AddWindow]
    DA --> DA1[Create Silk.NET Window]
    DA1 --> DA2[Register Window Callbacks]
    DA2 --> DA3[Start Window Loop]
    DA3 --> D1

    D1 -->|Remove| DR[Dequeue CloseWindow]
    DR --> DR1[Request Silk Window Close]
    DR1 --> D1

    D1 -->|None| E[Update Engine Timing]

    %% =========================================================
    %% FIXED SIMULATION
    %% =========================================================

    E --> F{Fixed Update Required?}

    F -->|Yes| F1[Run ECS Fixed Systems]
    F1 --> F2[Character Controllers]
    F2 --> F3[Physics Pre-Step]
    F3 --> F4[Physics Simulation]
    F4 --> F5[Collision Detection / Resolution]
    F5 --> F6[Dispatch Collision Events]
    F6 --> F7[Apply Deferred ECS Changes]
    F7 --> F8[Consume Fixed Time]
    F8 --> F

    %% =========================================================
    %% VARIABLE UPDATE
    %% =========================================================

    F -->|No| G[Consume Input Snapshot]

    G --> G1[Run Gameplay ECS Systems]
    G1 --> G2[AI / Navigation]
    G2 --> G3[State Machines]
    G3 --> G4[Animation Systems]
    G4 --> G5[Transform Systems]
    G5 --> G6[Audio Systems]
    G6 --> G7[Apply Deferred ECS Changes]

    %% =========================================================
    %% RENDER SNAPSHOT
    %% =========================================================

    G7 --> H[Build Render Snapshot]

    H --> H1[Copy World Transforms]
    H1 --> H2[Collect Mesh / Material Handles]
    H2 --> H3[Collect Bone Matrices]
    H3 --> H4[Collect Lights]
    H4 --> H5[Collect Camera Data]
    H5 --> H6[Collect Renderable ECS State]

    H6 --> I[Publish Render Snapshot]

    %% =========================================================
    %% ASYNC COMPLETION
    %% =========================================================

    I --> J[Process Completed Async Work]

    J --> J1[Asset Load Completions]
    J1 --> J2[Background Job Completions]
    J2 --> J3[Deferred Resource Cleanup]

    J3 --> K[End Engine Iteration]

    K --> A